        "content": "import pytest\nfrom pipeline.normalize import fold_name, normalize\n\n@pytest.mark.xfail(reason=\"Phase 2 not implemented\", strict=True)\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\"raw,expected\", [\n    (\"Acme Inc.\", \"acme\"),\n    (\"ACME INC\", \"acme\"),\n    (\"  Acme   Inc  \", \"acme\"),\n    (\"Nordwind GmbH\", \"nordwind\"),\n    (\"Pvt Ltd Traders\", \"traders\"),          # suffix + leading-word ordering\n    (\"\", \"\"),                                 # empty input\n    (\"Acme (Holdings)\", \"acme (holdings)\"),  # punctuation NOT a legal suffix — must not be stripped blindly\n])\ndef test_fold_name(raw, expected):\n    assert fold_name(raw) == expected\n\n@pytest.mark.xfail(reason=\"Phase 2 not implemented\", strict=True)\ndef test_normalize_preserves_original_name_alongside_folded():\n    # Folding is RECORDED, NOT DESTRUCTIVE — both `name` and `normalized_name` must survive.\n    [entity] = normalize([{\"externalId\": \"1\", \"name\": \"ACME INC\"}],\n                          entity_type=\"account\", source_id=\"src-a\")\n    assert entity.name == \"ACME INC\"\n    assert entity.normalized_name == \"acme\"\n\n@pytest.mark.xfail(reason=\"Phase 2 not implemented\", strict=True)\ndef test_normalize_handles_missing_optional_fields():\n    [entity] = normalize([{\"externalId\": \"1\", \"name\": \"X\"}], entity_type=\"account\", source_id=\"src-a\")\n    assert entity.parent_external_id is None\n    assert entity.last_modified_at is None\n\n@pytest.mark.xfail(reason=\"Phase 2 not implemented\", strict=True)\ndef test_normalize_empty_input_returns_empty_list():\n    assert normalize([], entity_type=\"account\", source_id=\"src-a\") == []\n```\n\n```python\n",
